macOS port
==========

This repository is a downstream build of
https://github.com/Ocanamat/Postbird (MIT licensed), which targets Windows
only. The CSS design tokens, components, and structure are the upstream
authors' work, unmodified except where noted below.

Changes made in this fork:
- Windows-only PowerShell deploy scripts (`scripts/*.ps1`) removed. Replaced
  with a manual macOS install path documented in the README.
- Dark mode support added: the folder pane, main toolbar, tab strip, status
  bar, and compose window now switch palettes via
  `@media (prefers-color-scheme: …)`, where upstream (untested outside
  Windows light mode) previously pinned them to a single light palette.
- `.github/FUNDING.yml` removed (not applicable to the macOS fork).

This is a personal downstream port, not affiliated with or endorsed by the
upstream project.
